      "content": "i feel like such a joke. my parents sacrificed everything to get me here, moved across the world so i could have this life, and i just... i can't even keep it together. i messed up so bad at work and now i feel like i've ruined the one thing they actually worked for. i'm just a massive disappointment to everyone who ever believed in me.",
