    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's too late for \"small steps.\" the shame of it... it's like if i can't be the person they needed me to be, then i'm just a lie. every time i look at them, i just feel like i'm taking up space that someone better should be using. it would be so much easier if they just saw me as the success they thought i was, instead of seeing me like this.",
